.minute-bank/

# Whole copies of this repository, created by isolated agent runs. A
# machine-local .git/info/exclude may also cover these, but that file
# never travels with a clone — and an unignored full repo copy in the
# working tree is the largest possible version of the incident recorded
# in docs/HANDOFF.md §6b-i, where `git add -A` swept a background
# agent's edit into a commit.
.claude/worktrees/

# The shared FMP circuit breaker's marker — machine state, never committed.
.fmp-circuit.json
.fmp-usage.json

# R3 emit corpora (~30 GB per arm); the manifests, redacted stdout tables and reader outputs are tracked
docs/research/r3/*.jsonl
# The raw stdout logs stay local (the driver's table prints the SEALED confirm
# fold's outcome columns per market); the tracked evidence is the redacted
# *.stdout-redacted.txt beside them, which starvation-audit reads identically.
docs/research/r4/*.jsonl
docs/research/r4/*.jsonl.rejections.jsonl
